{"4437750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Worst Airline Ever", "steam_appid": 4437750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEAR PASSENGERS, WELCOME ABOARD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends have bought an old, rusty airplane from a bankrupt airline. Now it's your turn to build an airline from scratch and transform it from a small regional carrier into a world-class airline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly airplanes inspired by real aircraft, work together as Captain, Co-Pilot, and Cabin Crew, serve passengers, design and upgrade your airplane, and make every flight count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN TO FLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your airplane is inspired by real passenger aircraft with approachable flight systems based on real aviation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master takeoffs, landings, navigation, autopilot, and increasingly challenging weather as your pilot rank grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/eaa9e7b088205caa4653a3f13ce52606.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/eaa9e7b088205caa4653a3f13ce52606.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/eaa9e7b088205caa4653a3f13ce52606.mp4?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two flights are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing weather, turbulence, passenger requests, and unexpected emergencies will keep the whole crew busy until the wheels touch the runway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/383be9fb7e5ef24d715b9bfd5b11c02c.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/383be9fb7e5ef24d715b9bfd5b11c02c.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/383be9fb7e5ef24d715b9bfd5b11c02c.mp4?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running an airline takes teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the pilots operate the airplane, the cabin crew serves passengers, handles onboard situations, and keeps everyone happy from departure to arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/5d739cd9d8c1114164fdc7a2c53d3f44.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/5d739cd9d8c1114164fdc7a2c53d3f44.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/5d739cd9d8c1114164fdc7a2c53d3f44.mp4?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN YOUR PLANE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your airplane your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cabin layout, seating classes, and onboard amenities to balance profit, comfort, and passenger satisfaction. Then customize the exterior to make your airline stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/864f9693521b36a434767cbb15f68bbf.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/864f9693521b36a434767cbb15f68bbf.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/864f9693521b36a434767cbb15f68bbf.mp4?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/45fa1647898540c40c6b1188df608193.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/45fa1647898540c40c6b1188df608193.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/45fa1647898540c40c6b1188df608193.mp4?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REACH NEW DESTINATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your reputation one flight at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy passengers and safe landings unlock larger airports, longer routes, and greater rewards. Each airport offers unique upgrade opportunities for your airplane. But crashes, onboard fires, poor service, and other disasters can quickly send your airline back to the bottom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/a142734ff327a52869d423d2179254a9.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/a142734ff327a52869d423d2179254a9.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/a142734ff327a52869d423d2179254a9.mp4?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own airline from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 1-4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Captain, Co-Pilot, or Cabin Crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplanes inspired by real passenger aircraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn approachable flight procedures based on real aviation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and upgrade your airplane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cabin layout and exterior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock larger airports and destinations around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and unexpected in-flight events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a regional airline into a global aviation empire.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEAR PASSENGERS, WELCOME ABOARD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends have bought an old, rusty airplane from a bankrupt airline. Now it's your turn to build an airline from scratch and transform it from a small regional carrier into a world-class airline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly airplanes inspired by real aircraft, work together as Captain, Co-Pilot, and Cabin Crew, serve passengers, design and upgrade your airplane, and make every flight count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN TO FLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your airplane is inspired by real passenger aircraft with approachable flight systems based on real aviation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master takeoffs, landings, navigation, autopilot, and increasingly challenging weather as your pilot rank grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa