_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/5d739cd9d8c1114164fdc7a2c53d3f44.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/5d739cd9d8c1114164fdc7a2c53d3f44.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/5d739cd9d8c1114164fdc7a2c53d3f44.mp4?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN YOUR PLANE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your airplane your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cabin layout, seating classes, and onboard amenities to balance profit, comfort, and passenger satisfaction. Then customize the exterior to make your airline stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/864f9693521b36a434767cbb15f68bbf.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/864f9693521b36a434767cbb15f68bbf.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/864f9693521b36a434767cbb15f68bbf.mp4?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/45fa1647898540c40c6b1188df608193.poster.avif?t=1788117755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/extras/45fa1647898540c40c6b1188df608193.webm?t=1788117755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/