p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a regional airline into a global aviation empire.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Build an airline from scratch in this multiplayer co-op airline management game. Fly airplanes inspired by real aircraft, design and upgrade your plane, serve passengers, and grow your airline from a small regional carrier into a world-class airline.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Czech, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/31cc2bfc231f54d0e4cb261ace620f9b133825a4/header.jpg?t=1788117755", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/354271597fcc7cc369b36982290b40ca9e9b60bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788117755", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437750/354271597fcc7cc369b36982290b40ca9e9b60bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788117755", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 2GB / AMD R9 280 / Intel Iris Xe<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit OS and processor required. SSD recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"